AD-5965.description:
Hi Bryson Fraley

I chatted you in Teams a little bit about this.

We recently updated versions for Airbnb with Bart Dziedzic

But there was a feature I missed in the documentation for the update, and it’s pretty important.

https://developer.airbnb.com/reference/updatelisting

deactivation_reason

string

The reason for listing deactivation. Value should be one of the values from the GET Deactivation Flow response. This should be set when also setting has_availability to false on the listing. For example: OtherReasons, NotAvailable etc.

I believe it should be as ‘simple’ as making our JSON like this when we set to unPublish,

{
  "has_availability": false,
  "deactivation_reason": "OtherReasons"
}

